    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-ecology/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Prime Ecology is a modern, eco-friendly, and sustainability-focused theme crafted for green businesses, environmental organizations, eco lodges, nature resorts, wildlife conservation projects, organic farms, renewable energy startups, and sustainable lifestyle brands. Perfect for NGOs, recycling centers, eco-tourism agencies, climate action groups, organic food producers, and clean energy companies focusing on solar, wind, and hydro solutions, this theme highlights your environmental mission with elegance and purpose. It offers a responsive, customizable, and SEO-optimized layout that ensures flawless performance across all devices while helping your eco initiatives gain visibility online. Ideal for promoting green products, sustainable packaging, biodegradable goods, zero-waste lifestyles, and eco-friendly fashion, Prime Ecology uses earthy color palettes, natural imagery, and minimalist layouts that reflect your brand’s commitment to protecting the planet. It supports environmental campaigns, awareness drives, and green fundraising projects, allowing you to connect with conscious consumers and supporters globally. Built with optimized code and social media integration, the theme encourages community engagement, advocacy, and content sharing. With compatibility for WooCommerce, you can sell organic products, handmade crafts, or eco-friendly merchandise, while Contact Form 7 enables easy communication and inquiry management. It also supports key plugins like GiveWP for environmental donations, WPForms for eco campaign registrations, and The Events Calendar for sustainability workshops or tree plantation drives. Whether you’re promoting renewable energy, clean water initiatives, green building projects, or sustainable agriculture practices, Prime Ecology provides a professional and engaging platform to inspire change and promote environmental responsibility. Its translation-ready design, smooth navigation, and visually rich sections make it perfect for global green brands and ecological startups dedicated to creating a better, cleaner, and more sustainable future."
    },
